## Unresolved / steps not completed

- No requested command was skipped.
- The full DiSyL suite and `composer test` could not achieve a green exit because of the pre-existing include-root defect above.
- Privileged deletion via `sudo` was unavailable; genuine cold-cache runs were completed through the temporary `www-data` cleaner instead.

## Recommended next state

Keep the raw-text engine fix and regression test. Track the include-root behavior as a separate DiSyL engine defect and resolve it before requiring an entirely green suite.
